{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/f617ab58204a718ae1198e71c9cc3c67.avif?t=1759676549\" width=778 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/47e51c33a5f7cc3516276aff9cc03cc1.poster.avif?t=1759676549\" width=940 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/47e51c33a5f7cc3516276aff9cc03cc1.webm?t=1759676549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world where every piece of information is filtered, and every civilian is under strict surveillance.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an <strong>interrogator</strong>, a government agent, who\u2019s been sent to a new sector to investigate an <strong>infection outbreak</strong>. <strong>Follow</strong> a <strong>strict protocol</strong>:\u00a0<u><strong>Interrogation. Search. Verdict.</strong></u>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/7e7754a37f8a2af07a611d1713ccd8ea.avif?t=1759676549\" width=778 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/428b2ba9810bce794f114d700b6d11f7.poster.avif?t=1759676549\" width=940 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/428b2ba9810bce794f114d700b6d11f7.webm?t=1759676549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself into the <strong>unforgettable atmosphere of an underground <u>GIGABUNKER</u></strong>, where humanity seeks a salvation from the global cataclysm. Experience the daily routine of inhabitants while exploring stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use every bit of information to reconstruct what happened.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/25732d0645963fc19bc8185b9bc4c440.avif?t=1759676549\" width=778 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/48dfbaebd8ebd8a84339bd662c251f9f.poster.avif?t=1759676549\" width=940 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/48dfbaebd8ebd8a84339bd662c251f9f.webm?t=1759676549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Fatum</strong> <strong>gives you a real challenge</strong> with <strong>no help from the outside</strong>. You can only rely on your intuition, <strong>putting together visual clues and civilians\u2019 statements</strong>. There\u2019s no telling that your choice is right. No mind palace or hints. Only you and your wit.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/4248c642bb1a1a6a53b47c50e4740683.avif?t=1759676549\" width=778 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful, because every action has its consequences.\u00a0 Only you can choose your approach, whether it\u2019ll be aggressive or helpful, it is possible to help resolve inhabitants\u2019 problems to discover new information. But the deeper you go, you understand one thing \u2013 the infection isn\u2019t the only danger\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your goals:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore home units, gather clues and <strong>subtle</strong> details.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyse the data and <strong>determine who is infected</strong>, prove your evidence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold interrogations but remember: <strong>people can lie</strong> \u2013 see through them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take hard decisions: <strong>save the innocent or follow the protocol.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Admire the <strong>unique visual style</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only you <strong>decide how the story ends</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve <strong>difficult and complex puzzles</strong>, which will shine the light on the truth.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3568740?t=1759676549","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/d868e49c36add484c73565ed5c86ca16d65c4eb3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759676549","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/dc45f39b3ee9e46255a4d5e8bf46794b13c03fea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759676549","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/dc45f39b3ee9e46255a4d5e8bf46794b13c03fea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759676549","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/f617ab58204a718ae1198e71c9cc3c67.avif?t=1759676549\" width=778 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/47e51c33a5f7cc3516276aff9cc03cc1.poster.avif?t=1759676549\" width=940 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/47e51c33a5f7cc3516276aff9cc03cc1.webm?t=1759676549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world where every piece of information is filtered, and every civilian is under strict surveillance.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an <strong>interrogator</strong>, a government agent, who\u2019s been sent to a new sector to investigate an <strong>infection outbreak</strong>. <strong>Follow</strong> a <strong>strict protocol</strong>:\u00a0<u><strong>Interrogation. Search. Verdict.</strong></u>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/7e7754a37f8a2af07a611d1713ccd8ea.avif?t=1759676549\" width=778 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/428b2ba9810bce794f114d700b6d11f7.poster.avif?t=1759676549\" width=940 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/428b2ba9810bce794f114d700b6d11f7.webm?t=1759676549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself into the <strong>unforgettable atmosphere of an underground <u>GIGABUNKER</u></strong>, where humanity seeks a salvation from the global cataclysm. Experience the daily routine of inhabitants while exploring stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use every bit of information to reconstruct what happened.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/25732d0645963fc19bc8185b9bc4c440.avif?t=1759676549\" width=778 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/48dfbaebd8ebd8a84339bd662c251f9f.poster.avif?t=1759676549\" width=940 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/48dfbaebd8ebd8a84339bd662c251f9f.webm?t=1759676549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Fatum</strong> <strong>gives you a real challenge</strong> with <strong>no help from the outside</strong>. You can only rely on your intuition, <strong>putting together visual clues and civilians\u2019 statements</strong>. There\u2019s no telling that your choice is right. No mind palace or hints. Only you and your wit.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/4248c642bb1a1a6a53b47c50e4740683.avif?t=1759676549\" width=778 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful, because every action has its consequences.\u00a0 Only you can choose your approach, whether it\u2019ll be aggressive or helpful, it is possible to help resolve inhabitants\u2019 problems to discover new information. But the deeper you go, you understand one thing \u2013 the infection isn\u2019t the only danger\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your goals:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore home units, gather clues and <strong>subtle</strong> details.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyse the data and <strong>determine who is infected</strong>, prove your evidence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold interrogations but remember: <strong>people can lie</strong> \u2013 see through them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take hard decisions: <strong>save the innocent or follow the protocol.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Admire the <strong>unique visual style</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only you <strong>decide how the story ends</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve <strong>difficult and complex puzzles</strong>, which will shine the light on the truth.</p></li></ul>","developers":["DreamLift Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/844282f16dd8c1b743d81a93c8939b9ec8382c65/header.jpg?t=1759676549","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3568740/880334/996550ace28c42faa87f53320f8c07ac461afc91/1750468148/dash_av1.mpd?t=1746661413","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3568740/880334/996550ace28c42faa87f53320f8c07ac461afc91/1750468148/dash_h264.mpd?t=1746661413","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3568740/880334/996550ace28c42faa87f53320f8c07ac461afc91/1750468148/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1746661413","id":257132389,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132389/movie480.mp4?t=1746661413","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132389/movie_max.mp4?t=1746661413"},"name":"The Fatum Teaser EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257132389/30c698204131492b05bacb3af9020ab1cf2a893d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746661413","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132389/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746661413","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132389/